#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"usage\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Usage</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"connect\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Connect</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Start kvpnc and if vpnc-connect/vpnc-disconnect is not installed in /usr/sbin change it in settings. Click on \"New profile...\" to add a new profile. Enter the new name in the upcoming dialog, fill in the empty fields and save the profile by clicking on \"Save profile...\". After enter your VPN data, click on \"connect\" to connect to your VPN server. By default, kvpnc minimizes into kicker dock after successful connect. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"disconnect\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Disconnect</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>To disconnect, click on kicker dock and kvpnc main window will be restored. Then click on \"disconnect\". You can also use toolbar icons or menu entries in kicker dock context menu. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"external_help\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Getting external help</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"homepage\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Homepage</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Go to <a href=\"http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/\">http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/</a> for new releases, contacts, etc. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"sumbitting_bugs\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Submitting bugs</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Go to <a href=\"https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc\">https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc</a> for submitting new bugs or look for open bugs. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"author\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Author</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Send a mail to Christoph Thielecke (<a href=\"u15119@hs-harz.de\">u15119@hs-harz.de</a>) if you have questions, suggestions or wishes. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "</body></html>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /></head><body style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:helvetica\">\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><a name=\"topic\"><span style=\"font-size:24pt;font-weight:600\">Themen</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"#usage\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Bruuk</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#connect\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Tokoppeln</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#disconnect\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Afkoppeln</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"#external_help\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Anner Hülp</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#homepage\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Tohuussiet</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#submitting_bugs\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Fehlers künnig maken</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#author\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Programmschriever</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"usage\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Bruuk</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"connect\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Tokoppeln</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Start KVpnc, un änner de Instellen, wenn \"vpnc-connect\"/\"vpnc-disconnect\" nich binnen /usr/sbin installeert sünd. Klick op \"Nieg Profil...\", wenn Du en nieg Profil tofögen wullt. Giff den niegen Naam binnen den Dialoog in, de denn opduken deit, füll de leddigen Feller ut un seker dat Profil mit en Klick op \"Profil sekern...\". Na't Ingeven vun de VPN-Daten kannst Du op \"Tokoppeln\" klicken, wenn Du denn den VPN-Server tokoppeln wullt. Standardwies minimeert KVpnc sik na't Tokoppeln na't Paneel. <a href=\"#topic\">torüch na baven</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"disconnect\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Afkoppeln</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Wullt Du Di afkoppeln, klick op't Paneeldock, denn warrt dat KVpnc-Hööftfinster wedderherstellt. Klick denn op \"Afkoppeln\". Du kannst ok de Knööp oder Menüindrääg binnen dat Paneeldock sien Rechtsklickmenü bruken. <a href=\"#topic\">torüch na baven</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"external_help\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Anner Hülp</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"homepage\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Tohuusseit</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Kiek op <a href=\"http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/\">http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/</a> na nieg Utgaven, Kontakten usw. <a href=\"#topic\">torüch na baven</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"sumbitting_bugs\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Fehlers künnig maken</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Op <a href=\"https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc\">https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc</a> kannst Du Fehlers künnig maken oder na al opmaakt Fehlers söken. <a href=\"#topic\">torüch na baven</a> </p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"author\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Autor</span></a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "<p>Stüer Christoph Thielecke (<a href=\"u15119@hs-harz.de\">u15119@hs-harz.de</a>) en Nettbreev to, wenn Du Fragen, Vörslääg oder Wünsch hest. <a href=\"#topic\">torüch na baven</a></p>"
#~ "\n"
#~ "</body></html>"

